WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:02.900
- We're entering an era
in which our enemies

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.220
can make it look like
anyone is saying anything

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:06.890
at any point in time.

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:09.380
Even if they would never say those things.

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:14.380
So, for instance, they could
have me say things like,

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:18.210
I don't know, "Killmonger was right,"

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:21.200
or "Ben Carson is in the sunken place,"

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.737
or, how about this, simply,

00:00:23.737 --> 00:00:26.537
"President Trump is a total
and complete dipshit."

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:31.570
Now, you see, I would
never say these things.

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:33.000
At least not in a public address.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.770
But, someone else would.

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:38.623
Someone like Jordan Peel.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.393
This is a dangerous time.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:45.540
Moving forward, we need
to be more vigilant

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.040
with what we trust from the internet.

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:51.613
It's a time when we need to
rely on trusted news sources.

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:56.273
May sound basic, but how we move forward,

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:01.350
age of information is
gonna be the difference

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:04.310
between whether we survive
or whether we become

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:06.820
some kind of fucked up dystopia.

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:09.663
Thank you, and stay woke bitches.

